&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 18pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-indent: -18pt; text-align: justify;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;(1)&lt;/font&gt; &lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;On January 9, 2026, we refinanced our variable rate term loan as discussed below.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; font-style: italic;"&gt;Debt Modification and Repayments&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;On November 18, 2024, we amended our Term Loan to extend the date of maturity from May 1, 2025 to January 30, 2026. The amended Term Loan continued to bear interest without modification from the original agreement.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 16pt; text-align: justify;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;Our Term Loan bore interest at various benchmark rates plus margins ranging from 2.10% to 2.475%. For the years ended December 31, 2025 and 2024, the average interest rate was 6.72% and 7.60%, respectively. As of December 31, 2025, all remaining quarterly principal payments were prepaid and the remaining balance was repaid in January 2026 as described below. For the years ended December 31, 2025 and 2024, we repaid $2,500,000 and $5,375,000, respectively, on the Term Loan.&lt;/font&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; font-style: italic;"&gt;Debt Covenants&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;The Term Loan and related collateral security documents contained certain covenant restrictions typical with this type of financing arrangement. These covenants&amp;#160;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;included restrictions&lt;/font&gt; &lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;on additional debt offerings&lt;/font&gt; &lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;by us, restrictions on encumbrances&lt;/font&gt; &lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;of our property or assets, and other restrictions. For the years&lt;/font&gt; &lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;ended December 31, 2025 and 2024, we were in compliance with&lt;/font&gt; &lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;our debt related covenants. As a result of the subsequent repayment of the Term Loan in January 2026, no debt covenant compliance reporting was required by the lender at&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;&amp;#160;December 31, 2025.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; font-style: italic;"&gt;Subsequent Event&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;On January 9, 2026, we issued $22,000,000 of 5.27% Senior Secured Notes, due April 30, 2035. Principal payments of $580,000 are payable quarterly, commencing on March 31, 2026. Net proceeds from the issuance of approximately $21,661,000 were primarily used to repay our amended Term Loan due January 30, 2026. &lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; font-weight: bold;"&gt;6. Related Party Transactions&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial; font-style: italic;"&gt;Affiliate Balances and Activities&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;
